# Refuse to install on a Node too old to run this at all.
#
# Every script here launches node with --experimental-strip-types, which arrived
# in 22.6. On anything older node rejects the flag before a single line of our
# code runs -- so `npm run setup` and `npm run doctor` both die with
#
#     node: bad option: --experimental-strip-types
#
# and the friendly "needs Node >= 22.6" check inside preflight.ts can never be
# reached by the one person who needs to read it. Failing at install time, where
# npm prints the required range against the version actually installed, is the
# only place this can be caught in time to help.
engine-strict=true
